					"usage": "Breath Weapon",
					"defaults": [
						{
							"type": "10",
							"modifier": 3
						}
					],
					"usage_notes": "Breath Weapon (13): A 10-yard jet of magma erupts from the mephit’s mouth. He uses Innate Attack (Breath) to hit. Don’t apply range penalties; treat this as a long melee weapon rather than a ranged attack. It does 1d burning damage, and has a 1/2D range of 5 yards. If any damage penetrates the target’s DR, he must make a HT roll, at -1 per 2 points of injury or suffer from moderate pain (p. B428) for (20 – HT) minutes as his skin and eyes burn and itch.This ability costs 1 FP to use."
				}
